{title: Babuji Dheere Chalna}
{artist: Geeta Dutt O P Nayyar}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m] Babuji Dheere Chalna,        Pyaar [G#m] Mein Zara Sam [D#m] bhalna
[D#m] Haan Bade Dhokhe Hain,        [D#m] Bade Dhokhe Hai [G#m] Iss Raah [D#m] Me
[D#] Kyon Ho Khoye Hue, Sar [A#] Jhukaaye,        [A#] Jaise Jaate Ho Sab Kuchh [D#] Lutaaye
[D#] Yeh Toh Babuji Pehla [G#] Qadam Hai,        [A#] Nazar Aate Hain Apne [D#] Paraaye
[D#m] Haan Bade Dhokhe Hain,        [D#m] Bade Dhokhe Hai [G#m] Iss Raah [D#m] Me
[D#m] Babuji Dheere Chalna,        [D#] Yeh Mohabbat Hai O Bhole [A#] Bhale,
[A#] Kar Na Dil Ko Ghamon Ke [D#] Hawaale,        [D#] Kaam Ulfat Ka Naazuk [G#] Bahut Hai,
[A#] Aake Hothon Pe Tootenge [D#] Pyaale,        [D#m] Haan Bade Dhokhe Hain,
[D#m] Bade Dhokhe Hai [G#m] Iss Raah [D#m] Me,        [D#m] Babuji Dheere Chalna,
[D#] Ho Gayi Hai Kisi Se Jo [A#] An-Ban,        [A#] Thaam Le Doosra Koi [D#] Daaman
[D#] Zindgaani Ki Raahein [G#] Ajab Hain,        [A#] Ho Akela Toh Laakhon Hain [D#] Dushman
[D#m] Haan Bade Dhokhe Hain,        [D#m] Bade Dhokhe Hai [G#m] Iss Raah [D#m] Me
[D#m] Babuji Dheere Chalna,
